WEBVTT

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.140
Duty

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:27.520
It was pretty, but that left 
eye was never of any use.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.590
Was that a signal warning that 
the leads will be changing soon?

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.370
So this is the Imperial Capital...

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:43.730
It's amazing.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:47.750
Everywhere you look, it's 
teeming with people.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:50.230
Not to mention Shadow Eaters...

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.090
Human villages have certainly 
grown boisterous.

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.490
What are Shadow Eaters?

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.410
A type of low-level spirit.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.790
Honestly, they don't pose-

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:02.020
Hey! Keep your head down 
in places like this.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.250
Child, how dare you?!

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:06.190
You'll attract attention.

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:09.130
Wait up, Shino!

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:14.860
Pardon me.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:16.820
No, if you'll pardon me.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:55.070
Oh, Shino! I haven't seen ya in ages!

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:58.050
Yo! I have a favor to ask of you.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:03:00.560
Crossroads

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.940
Would you be willing to 
look after him for a while?

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.580
It's a pleasure to meet 
you. I'm Shinobu Inue.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.330
Um... Get this off of me.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.450
I see...

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:15.330
So that would explain why 
my gem emitted a mysterious

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.340
light a while back.

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:22.130
My word!

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.680
Shinobu, don't these look 
just like your ball?

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:26.350
Uh-huh.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.350
This brings us to seven...

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.940
If these are the gems in the 
legend about Princess Fuse,

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:35.150
that'd make us the reincarnations 
of the Eight Dog Warriors...

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.480
Does that sound 'bout right?

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:41.600
The legend says that she'll 
grant our wishes when

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:43.240
all eight gems come together...

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:44.740
Our wishes...

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.240
Could I wish for somethin' 
like, "I want a girlfriend"?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.520
Even if it's just small talk,

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:54.560
I want to actually talk to 
women every now and then!

00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:01.760
I'd like overflowing talent 
that never runs dry...

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.760
Money for me.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:07.870
May Shino grow up soon!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:09.260
Dude...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.520
Princess Fuse will have her hands full.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:17.750
At any rate, we'll never get anywhere 
without Sosuke's Gem of Duty.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:21.030
I can't help that it got stolen.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:23.350
Now, now!

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:24.660
Shinobu, was it?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.940
Stay here for as long as you like!

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:27.030
Make yourself at home!

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.540
Okay! Thank you very much.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.350
Oh, Sosuke! Sorry for 
always making you do that.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.060
It's fine.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:34.440
Hey, I'll take some tea!

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.850
Do you have any snacks?

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.360
Are you hungry already?

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.040
Back off!

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.880
Come to think of it, what was 
that critter in the entryway?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.110
Isn't it as cute as a button?

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.490
It ain't cute!

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:47.660
By the way, this appeared 
not too long ago.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.620
What is that? A cut?

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.910
Did you get hurt?

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.310
No, actually...

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:04.010
I didn't mean to scare you...

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.840
You scared our pants off!

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:06.820
And on top of that...

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:09.830
It can also do this.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.740
Daikaku, what the heck is that?!

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.490
To be honest, I'm not 
entirely certain...

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.570
Yikes! Don't look at me!

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:27.950
That is an evil eye.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.350
An evil eye?

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:32.210
It is a cat's eye that 
can perceive those

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:35.350
who are not human and destroy them.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.920
It would seem you have been 
endowed with a spirit's powers.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:40.360
Do any spirits come to mind?

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:42.860
Yeah...

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.550
That's kinda unnerving...

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.760
It makes my fur stand on end.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:50.890
Yeah!

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.680
That's better.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.870
Spirits are currently roaming 
all across the Imperial Capital.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:00.060
I can't afford to have "accidents" 
happening all the time.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:02.730
Seriously, this is one weird lot.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:04.280
That eye-! That eye-!

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.990
Say, why don't we go ahead and eat?

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:10.240
Sweet! Food! Food!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.190
The food here is to die for!

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:13.300
Eat all you want!

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:13.890
Okay!

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:19.230
Shino, I'm heading on back 
to the Four Houses' manor.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:21.650
I have some things to attend to.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.000
'Kay!

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:32.940
Huh? It shrunk down a bit...

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:35.360
How does this work?

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:38.440
Uh, don't...

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:41.210
Shinobu, you did it again?

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:45.530
This is gross. Hurry 
and get it off of me.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.780
You don't have to be so mean to him.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:53.990
Good discipline is important!

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:58.080
It's their pet, isn't it?

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:04.920
So what did you want to talk about?

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.480
It's about Sosuke.

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:08.300
Doesn't something seem off?

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:10.260
Huh? About Sosuke?

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.560
I suppose you can't tell when 
you're with him all of the time.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:15.490
What are you getting at?

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.750
He probably can't see 
out of his left eye.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:22.250
He can't...?!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:24.750
You never noticed?

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.300
His eye isn't the only 
part of him with issues.

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:31.880
When Sosuke was putting 
out a fire a while back,

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.410
he didn't feel the least bit of pain

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:36.070
despite sustaining horrible burns.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.200
What is going on here?

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.650
Did he...?

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.300
Is this Ao's doing?!

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:47.360
I am a shadow.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:51.030
Sosuke and I are two in one.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:54.970
Shino?!

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.890
Damn it!

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:59.140
Is that what he meant?!

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:00.160
But how the hell...?

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.180
Once I have everything,

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:05.920
that will be the time when 
I go to receive you, Shino.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.460
How did he steal it from Sosuke?

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:20.060
Is that right? You've 
found the eighth gem...

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.310
Right. One other thing...

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:24.330
We also chanced upon my shadow.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.070
While I'm here, let me 
share some juicy news.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:30.480
The Princess will awaken soon.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:34.820
You will never gather 
all eight of your gems.

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:40.060
I am not entirely sure 
what he was referring to,

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.960
but could the "Princess" he mentioned 
be the Princess Fuse of legend?

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:45.710
Or he could have meant 
the other princess.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:47.460
The other princess?

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.460
Princess Tamazusa.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:55.090
The legend encompassing her 
includes a tale along these lines:

00:08:56.620 --> 00:09:00.080
When Tamazusa left the neighboring 
country to come to our land,

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:03.160
she was accompanied 
by her two young sons.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.730
However, the government official 
rebuked her for bringing them.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.220
She was forced to choose 
which of her sons

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:12.020
she would surrender to the official.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:15.640
After agonizing over the decision...

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:19.670
...she offered up the 
younger of her sons.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:24.750
With his sickly constitution, his 
chances of survival were slim.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:27.750
He was taken away from her...

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:30.520
...and killed.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:37.760
But when the older son learned 
of this, he took his own life.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:43.080
In the end, Tamazusa 
lost both of her sons.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.660
You almost can't help but feel 
sorry for her after hearing that.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:00.530
But why would the shadow mention her...?

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:02.910
I don't know...

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.720
But there is no harm 
in exercising caution.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.590
Sosuke...

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.170
How long has your left 
eye been like this?

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.170
It started about a week ago.

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.780
First your left hand and 
now your left eye...

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:22.370
As your shadow grows stronger,

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:24.520
I expect that he will 
continue to steal from you.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.340
Shino will throw a fit 
if he ever finds out.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:30.190
That would be unfortunate.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:32.600
I will work something 
out before he does.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:34.600
I'll be taking my leave.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:43.700
Despite what I said, there is currently 
nothing I can do about this.

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:45.440
Sosuke!

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:05.600
Sosuke, you can't see 
right anymore, can you?

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.440
For how long?

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:09.600
Why didn't you say anything?!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.370
I'm fine.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.740
So far, it hasn't proven 
to be a hindrance.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:18.610
Like I'm gonna buy that! This 
was his doing, wasn't it?!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:20.760
Ao stole your...!

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.430
How did he steal your eye?

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.870
The bastard...!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.870
Where are you going?

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:33.550
You're wasting your time if you 
mean to wander about blindly!

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.150
Let go!

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:39.380
What'll you do if Ao keeps 
this up and steals everything?

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:43.910
It's not as though worrying 
about it will get us anywhere.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:47.060
Besides, this is my problem.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.730
Shino, it has nothing to do with you.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:53.900
It has nothing...?

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:55.730
What the hell?

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.050
Then deal with it yourself!

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.150
I haven't been here in ages,

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.550
but I find this place 
as disagreeable as ever.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:22.420
Don't complain when you 
hardly ever bother to come.

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:24.370
Yeah, yeah...

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.300
By the way, did you know?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.450
Under the Headquarters' instructions,

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.060
the Old Castle District has 
supposedly been sealed off.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.060
They sealed it off?

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:37.000
Spirits have been 
gathering around there.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.610
Rumors say, strange things 
keeps happening around there.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:43.470
Doesn't this smell fishy?

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:48.080
The leaders are definitely 
schemin' up something nasty.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:58.090
Shino, it has nothing to do with you.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.090
Sosuke, you jerk!

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:02.570
Damn it!

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:10.100
Chikage?

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:12.680
I apologize for coming without warning.

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:16.600
Ayane said she wishes to see you 
briefly, hence I have come for you.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.540
Did something happen?

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.420
She is bedridden after catching a cold.

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:21.850
A cold...?

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:23.860
Are you sure I can go see her?

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:25.190
'Tis fine.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:28.170
With the medicine having taken effect, 
her complexion has improved greatly.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:29.870
Cool.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:32.180
Huh? Come to think of it,

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:33.890
you aren't in the same form 
you usually take, are you?

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:36.370
I find this season to 
be somewhat trying.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:39.980
Oh! 'Cause ya hibernate!

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:41.500
Hurry it up!

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:44.010
You caught a cold?

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:46.010
Shino!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:47.660
Are you okay?

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.510
Uh-huh. It looks like Hamaji's 
medicine is helping.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:53.410
I'm glad to hear it.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:57.020
But I have a feelin' she threw 
in some crazy ingredients.

00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:59.230
It's been a while!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.230
You haven't been by the 
manor in quite some time.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.400
Yeah, I had to take 
care of some stuff...

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:07.030
Shino, I heard you attended 
elementary school in Ikura.

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.140
Wha-?!

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.970
Kaname told me about it.

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:12.390
How was it? Did you enjoy yourself?

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:15.910
That fox punk...!

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:20.540
Uh, w-well, it was okay!

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:25.300
I have been eagerly awaiting 
your return, Shino.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:28.930
I was hoping you could tell 
me about your time at school.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:31.240
Uh, really?

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:34.310
I also love to listen to 
Hamaji's stories about school.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:37.380
Just the other day, a 
raccoon dog got into the

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:39.090
dormitory and caused 
quite the commotion!

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:39.810
And then...

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.320
Sosuke, I need emergency help!

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:44.510
Pardon?

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:47.130
This really stinks! This lies 
outside of my expertise.

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:49.890
Plus both Rio and Nachi 
are out right now!

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:51.720
How on Earth am I supposed 
to handle this?!

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:53.960
What precisely is the problem?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:56.080
It's HIM again...

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.850
He's all like, "I'm here!"

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.960
Welcome, Master Finnegan.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:08.610
I am terribly sorry to 
suddenly stop by unannounced.

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:09.480
No, that's fine!

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:10.970
I'm simply glad to see 
you're doing well.

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:14.600
Thank you. Inukawa, you're too kind.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:18.620
I caught word that Ayane is sick in bed.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:21.000
I was so worried that 
I was beside myself,

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.900
so I decided to pay her a visit.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:27.480
What'll you do if you make 
her condition grow worse?!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:31.130
The medicine has taken effect, 
so she is currently resting.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:35.520
I will make sure to tell Ayane that 
you came to see her, Master Finnegan.

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.490
Is that right?

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:39.500
Nice one, Sosuke!

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:43.060
In that case, I shouldn't 
overstay my welcome.

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:44.470
Phew!

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:50.760
But truly, this is 
such a pleasant manor.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:54.450
Oh, Shino!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.640
And then that geezer, Chudai-

00:15:58.830 --> 00:15:59.980
Master Chikage...

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:02.460
It is about time you got some rest.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:05.020
The promise was that this 
would be a brief visit.

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:07.550
Right...

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:11.500
I'll drop by again tomorrow.

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:14.640
Okay! I'll see you tomorrow, Shino.

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:15.600
Yeah!

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:20.040
Ayane is enthralled 
by stories of school.

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:22.510
She has never attended one herself,

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.380
making her all the more 
intrigued by them.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.260
I can understand.

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:28.190
I used to be the exact same way.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.610
You were?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.170
Say, Chikage?

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:35.320
What would you do if Ayane said 
she wanted to go to school?

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.180
That is not possible.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:42.780
She is not strong enough to spend 
long periods of time outside.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.460
She doesn't have to go for 
the Perfect Attendance Award.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.750
Even if it's only on her good days,

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:50.690
let her go outside as she likes and 
walk around on her own two feet.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.130
Promising to do something 
tomorrow with someone

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:56.520
is the same as promising that 
you'll be alive tomorrow.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.600
"I'll see you tomorrow," huh?

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:14.950
Shino, you need to get your rest!

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:16.780
We can keep going...

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.370
COMICS OF THE WORLD

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.340
I won't hear it.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:20.970
TRAVEL GUIDE FOR THE EAST

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.970
We can pick up where 
we left off tomorrow.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:23.840
Fine!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.100
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:26.540
Right!

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:32.610
Maybe I should apologize.

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:52.260
You've grown into a lad 
with rather strong eyes...

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:56.110
...just as your mother wanted.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.270
How come he knows my mother?

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.050
Are they acquaintances?

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:11.270
Wait. Even my dad never 
mentioned that to me...

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:16.130
Come to think of it, 
when did my mother die?

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:19.780
I can't even remember 
what she looks like.

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:23.290
I don't remember anything...

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:28.670
I've felt this way before, haven't I...?

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.110
Shino!

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:37.450
...aki no yo
 ...night is advancing

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:42.370
Tabi no sora no
 Alone, I lament over

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:47.960
Wabishiki omoi ni 
The forlorn feelings I have

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:52.560
Hitori nayamu
 While traveling under this sky

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:55.570
Bro-Bro, let's sing together!

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:57.570
Together?

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:58.730
Yup!

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:02.070
Bro-Bro, I'll teach you the words.

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:08.600
Koishiya furusato
 How I pine for home

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:12.840
Natsukashi chichi haha 
I miss my mother and father

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:16.490
Shino, are you all right?

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.070
Yeah, I'll be- Ugh!

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:23.470
I suspect Finnegan must 
have overwhelmed you.

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.660
Stay away from him henceforth.

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:26.950
Not really.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:28.950
I just so happened to 
walk by him was all.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.000
I'll go get some water.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:41.680
Koishiya furusato
 How I pine for home

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:45.820
Natsukashi chichi haha
 I miss my mother and father

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:47.680
What is it?

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.250
I can't seem to remember 
the next line...

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:54.000
"I think of the path 
through the forest".

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:56.000
Right?

00:19:58.070 --> 00:19:59.290
Is there a problem?

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:03.410
No, that's not right.
 Actually, you nailed it big time!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:04.430
Which is it?

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:08.490
The correct lyrics are, "I think 
of the forest treetops of home".

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:12.580
But I was taught, "the 
path through the forest".

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:18.280
How come you know the incorrect 
lyrics that I learned by mistake?

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:25.910
Nah, forget it. I'll 
let you off for now.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:28.210
But does this have

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:31.410
anything to do with why 
I can't remember my mom?

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:36.420
Why does that geezer know her?

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.170
If you can't remember something,

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:43.170
it is merely because it 
was not worth remembering.

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.780
No! I-

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:49.500
Shino, remember your mission.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:50.910
You mean the gems?

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:54.190
What good will gathering 
them actually do?

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:56.190
Sosuke should come first!

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.560
What the hell is happening to him?!

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:02.530
Your gems choose their owners.

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:05.260
Until they fulfill their purpose,

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:07.700
they will never allow 
their owners to die.

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:10.700
It can't be...!

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:14.710
Duty

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:14.210
Did the gem choose Ao over Sosuke?

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.710
Then... it's my fault...

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:24.090
Because I let him steal 
the gem, Sosuke is...

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:46.860
Have you obtained that which you desire?

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:48.150
Yeah,

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:49.870
but I'm not done yet.

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:53.610
I have to obtain everything.

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:41.060
Pursuit

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:29.240
Ah, my throat hurts!

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:32.030
Hey, future doctor! Could 
you take a look at it?

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:34.120
Certainly! Now take off 
all of your clothes.

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:35.160
Huh? Everything?

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:36.250
Get on with it!

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:38.410
W-we're talking about my throat here!
 I have a sore throat!

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:39.560
I'm just teasing.
